<title>USA: Colorado Casino sees Q3 EPS above $0.10.</title>
<headline>Colorado Casino sees Q3 EPS above $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colorado Casino Resorts Inc said it anticipates earnings of more than $0.10 per share beginning in its third quarter.</p>
<p>No further information on earnings was immediately available from the company.</p>
</text>
